# Vault conventions

- Canonical second-brain layer: `12_Brain/`. Never create `1Z_Brain/`.
- Agents start at `12_Brain/INDEX.md`, then walk links — do not sweep folders.
- `12_Brain/raw/` is read-only history. Compile into `entities/` / `concepts/`.
- Update `12_Brain/INDEX.md` in the same change when adding/removing wiki pages.
- Working folders (`00_Inbox` … `11_Agents`) stay outside `12_Brain/`; link, don't duplicate clients.
- Git is source of truth for agent writes. Do not race Obsidian Sync.
